      <p>Claude users write the longest reviews (30.7 words avg, 14% above the mean), with the highest word count for satisfied users (26.6 words for 5-star reviews). This suggests a more thoughtful, invested user base &mdash; a brand asset. Consider building community features, power-user programs, or testimonial campaigns that capitalize on this engagement depth rather than competing purely on volume metrics.</p>
